# 行尾与二进制处理规则。
#
# 此前仓库里 LF 与 CRLF 文件混放，靠每台机器的 core.autocrlf 默认值决定，
# 于是每次 git diff 都刷几十条 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告，真实改动
# 容易被淹没；更麻烦的是 deploy/*.sh 若被签出成 CRLF，在 Linux 上会因为
# shebang 后面的 \r 直接执行失败。

# 默认由 git 自动判断文本文件，检出时保持各平台习惯
* text=auto

# Shell 脚本与 git 钩子必须是 LF：CRLF 会让 Linux 上的 shebang 失效
*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止任何行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.gz binary
*.dem binary
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
*.wasm binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
